{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Ab}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 194}
{meta: category Jesus Christ - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Cm]Sing [Ab]we of [Cm]the [Bbm]modern [Db]city,
[Ab]Scene [Fm]alike [Ab]of [Fm/Ab]joy and stress;
[Cm]Sing [Ab]we of its [Fm]nameless [Gdim]people
[Ab]In [Fm]their urbanwilderness.
[Fm/C]Into [Bbm]endless rows [Gdim]of houses
[A7/G]Life is [Fm]set [A]amillionfold,
[Cm]Life [Eb]expressed [D]in [Bbm]human beings
[A7/G]Daily [Fm]born [A7]and [Bbm]growing [Gdim]old.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Cm]In [Ab]the city [Bbm]full [Db]of people,
[Ab]World [Fm]of speed [Ab]and [Fm/Ab]hectic days,
[Cm]In [Ab]the everchanging [Gdim]setting
[Ab]Of [Fm]the latest [Bbm]trend [Ab]and [Gdim]craze,
[Fm/C]Christ [Bbm]is present, and [Gdim]among [Bbm]us;
[A7/G]In the [Fm]crowd [A]we [Fm]see Him stand.
[Cm]In [Eb]the bustle [Bbm]of [Gdim]the city
[A7/G]Jesus [Fm]Christ is [Bbm]every [Gdim]man.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Cm]God [Ab]is not [Cm]remote [Db]in heaven,
[Ab]But [Fm]on earth [Ab]to [Fm/Ab]share our shame,
[Cm]Changing [Ab]graph and [Bbm]mass [Gdim]and number
[Ab]Into [Fm]persons [Bbm]with [Ab]a [Gdim]name.
[Fm/C]Christ [Bbm]has shown, [D]beyond [Bbm]statistics,
[A7/G]Human [Fm]life [A]with [Fm]glory crowned,
[Cm]By [Eb]His timeless [Bbm]presence [Gdim]proving
[A7/G]People [Fm]matter, [Bbm]people [Gdim]count!
{end_of_verse}
